<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia C&amp;C Bintang 1996 net up 43 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia C&amp;C Bintang 1996 net up 43 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	114.4     vs	80.2</p>
<p>    Net profit		  110.69    vs	77.32</p>
<p>    Turnover		  1,512.76    vs   1,394.78</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    160.38    vs     109.80</p>
<p>    Minorities	less	0.38    vs less  0.60</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     nil     vs add   5.19</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 45.0     vs	28.0</p>
<p>Note - Company's full name is Cycle &amp; Carriage Bintang Bhd. It assembles, distributes and retails cars.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
